      {
        "t": "mistake",
        "html": "Missing <b>ad-</b> when it changes shape. <i>ac-</i>, <i>af-</i>, <i>ag-</i>, <i>al-</i>, <i>an-</i>, <i>ap-</i>, <i>ar-</i>, <i>as-</i> and <i>at-</i> are all <i>ad-</i>: <i>accede</i> (go to), <i>affable</i> (easy to speak to), <i>alleviate</i> (make light). Look for the doubled consonant."
